    <string name="intrusion_log_instructions_title">How to download intrusion logs (Android 16+)</string>
    <string name="intrusion_log_instructions_body">Available on Android 16 and later with Advanced Protection enabled.\n\n1. Open Settings \u2192 Security &amp; privacy \u2192 Advanced Protection \u2192 Intrusion Logging\n\n2. Tap \"Access logs\" and download the .zip export\n\n3. Come back here, tap the button above, and select the downloaded .zip\n\nIntrusion logs record DNS lookups, network connections, and system security events from your device. AndroDR analyzes the export entirely on your device \u2014 nothing is uploaded to external servers.</string>
